This is just the Machine Learning Lifecycle in UiPath AI Center. Don't memorize all the points. Understand the story. 😊

Imagine you want to build a robot that identifies whether a customer email is:

Positive 😀
Negative 😠
Neutral 😐

Step 1: Data Collection & Preparation

First collect examples.

"I love your product"      → Positive
"Very bad service"         → Negative
"Need more information"    → Neutral


Clean the data and remove mistakes.

Remember:

📚 Collect and clean data
-----------------------------------

Step 2: Model Training

Give the cleaned data to a machine learning algorithm.

The model learns:

love → Positive
good → Positive

bad → Negative
poor → Negative

Remember:

🧠 Model learns patterns

------------------------------
Step 3: Packaging & Versioning

After training, save the model.

Version 1.0
Version 2.0
Version 3.0


Just like saving different versions of a project.

Example
V1 Accuracy = 80%
V2 Accuracy = 90%

Remember:

📦 Save and track versions
---------------------------------

Step 4: Deployment

Upload the trained model to UiPath AI Center.

Now it becomes an ML Skill.

Trained Model
      ↓
 AI Center
      ↓
 ML Skill

Remember:

🚀 Make the model available for use
-----------------------------------

Step 5: Integration with RPA

Now connect the ML Skill to UiPath Robot.

Example:

Customer Email arrives

Robot
   ↓
ML Skill
   ↓
Negative


Robot automatically:

Forward to Support Team

Remember:

🤖 Robot uses the model
-----------------------------------

Step 6: Monitoring & Improvement

Check whether predictions are correct.

Suppose:

Actual = Positive
Predicted = Negative


Oops ❌

Add more training data and retrain.

Create:

Version 4.0


which performs better.

Remember:

🔧 Monitor and improve
